# Tribute to Hunger: "Target opponent sacrifices a creature of their choice. You gain life equal to that creature's toughness." (CR 701.21a, 608.2h) Bot2 controls a Memnite (1/1) and an Ornithopter (0/2) and
# answers Tribute with Giant Growth on the Ornithopter (3/5). They choose it: only their own creatures can be chosen (not Bot1's Ornithopter), and Bot1 gains its toughness as it last existed, 5
# (not its power 3, nor its printed toughness 2): 20 -> 25. The Memnite stays.

